# The build context is the repository root. The image builds from the root
# manifests, docs/, packages/sdk-js, packages/viewer-web and spec/cv-1.0.md;
# the rest stays out.

# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-demo
**/.astro
**/.next
**/.turbo
docs/public/embed

# Environment files and scratch work
**/.env*
**/.tmp
.vercel
.git
.github
.claude

# Hosting files. docs/vps/nginx.conf is copied into the image.
docs/Dockerfile
docs/Dockerfile.dockerignore
docs/vps/compose.yaml
docs/vps/site.caddy
vercel.json

# Everything the site does not build from
integrations
launch
packages/embed-js
packages/mcp
packages/server-middleware-node
sdks
tools
spec/test-vectors
packages/sdk-js/tests
packages/sdk-js/examples
packages/viewer-web/tests
packages/viewer-web/demo
*.md

# Tooling caches and local files
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
